{
  "meta": {
    "name": "Duello Quiz design tokens",
    "version": "1.1.0",
    "owner": "designer",
    "notes": [
      "Source of truth for colours, type, spacing, shapes, elevation and motion.",
      "color.<theme>.scheme keys are named exactly like the parameters of androidx.compose.material3.ColorScheme (lightColorScheme / darkColorScheme). Map them 1:1.",
      "color.<theme>.game keys are custom semantic roles that ColorScheme does not have. Expose them through a CompositionLocal (e.g. LocalGameColors) with the same names.",
      "All colours are opaque sRGB hex. Alpha for disabled states follows Material 3: content 38 % of onSurface, container 12 % of onSurface (see stateLayer).",
      "Every text pair is checked in design/contrast-report.md (WCAG 2.1). Run design/tools/contrast.py after any colour change.",
      "Units: dp for sizes, sp for font sizes and line heights, ms for durations."
    ]
  },

